CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION getdocdetails(v_pagenumber integer, v_limit integer)
 RETURNS TABLE(datype character varying, dasubtype character varying, servicerequesttypeconfigroleid uuid, entityroletypekey character varying)
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
   DECLARE 
      v_liPageNumber  INT;              
      v_liPageSize   INT;
      v_pageoffset  INT;
BEGIN

  v_liPageNumber := v_pagenumber;
  v_liPageSize := v_limit ;

  v_liPageNumber := v_liPageNumber-1;
  v_pageoffset = v_liPageNumber * v_liPageSize;  

    RETURN QUERY

    
 
SELECT 
--G.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigId, 
--G.ActiveFlag AS ActiveFlag, 
--G.WorkLoad AS WorkLoad, 
--G.InternalFile AS InternalFile, 
--G.DueDateOffset AS DueDateOffset, 
--G.LimitedRouting AS LimitedRouting, 
--G.insertedby AS insertedby, 
--G.insertedon AS insertedon, 
--G.updatedby AS updatedby, 
--G.updatedon AS updatedon, 
--G.EffectiveDate AS EffectiveDate, 
--G.ExpirationDate AS ExpirationDate, 
--G.FocusRoletype AS FocusRoletype, 
--G.Category AS Category, 
--G.IntakeServReqTypeId AS IntakeServReqTypeId, 
--G.IntakeServReqTypeKey AS IntakeServReqTypeKey, 
G.Description AS DAType, 
--G.insertedby1 AS insertedby1, 
--G.insertedon1 AS insertedon1, 
--G.updatedby1 AS updatedby1, 
--G.updatedon1 AS updatedon1, 
--G.ArchiveOn AS ArchiveOn, 
--G.ArchiveBy AS ArchiveBy, 
--G.timestamp AS timestamp, 
--G.WorkLoadWeight AS WorkLoadWeight, 
--G.Investigatable AS Investigatable, 
--G.ServiceRequestSubTypeId AS ServiceRequestSubTypeId, 
--G.ClassKey AS ClassKey, 
G.Description1 AS DAsubtype, 
--G.insertedby2 AS insertedby2, 
--G.insertedon2 AS insertedon2, 
--G.updatedby2 AS updatedby2, 
--G.updatedon2 AS updatedon2, 
--G.timestamp1 AS timestamp1, 
--G.WorkLoadWeight1 AS WorkLoadWeight1, 
--G.Investigatable1 AS Investigatable1, 
--G.IntakeServReqTypeId1 AS IntakeServReqTypeId1, 
--G.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId AS IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId, 
--G.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeKey AS IntakeSerReqStatusTypeKey, 
--G.Description2 AS Description2, 
--G.insertedby3 AS insertedby3, 
--G.insertedon3 AS insertedon3, 
--G.updatedby3 AS updatedby3, 
--G.updatedon3 AS updatedon3, 
--G.ActiveFlag1 AS ActiveFlag1, 
--G.EffectiveDate1 AS EffectiveDate1, 
--G.ExpirationDate1 AS ExpirationDate1, 
--G.Timestamp2 AS Timestamp2, 
--G.SequenceNumber AS SequenceNumber, 
--G.IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey AS IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey, 
--G.ActiveFlag2 AS ActiveFlag2, 
--G.TypeDescription AS TypeDescription, 
--G.DataValue AS DataValue, 
--G.editable AS editable, 
--G.EffectiveDate2 AS EffectiveDate2, 
--G.ExpirationDate2 AS ExpirationDate2, 
--G.old_id AS old_id, 
--G.Timestamp3 AS Timestamp3, 
--G.C1 AS C1, 
--G.C2 AS C2, 
--G.C4 AS C3, 
--G.C3 AS C4, 
G.ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId, 
--G.EntityRoleType AS EntityRoleType, 
G.EntityRoleTypeKey AS EntityRoleTypeKey
--G.ActiveFlag3 AS ActiveFlag3, 
--G.EffectiveDate3 AS EffectiveDate3, 
--G.ExpirationDate3 AS ExpirationDate3, 
--G.insertedby4 AS insertedby4, 
--G.insertedon4 AS insertedon4, 
--G.updatedby4 AS updatedby4, 
--G.updatedon4 AS updatedon4, 
--G.timestamp4 AS timestamp4, 
--G.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId1 AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigId1
FROM ( SELECT 
 A.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigId, 
 A.ActiveFlag AS ActiveFlag, 
 A.WorkLoad AS WorkLoad, 
 A.InternalFile AS InternalFile, 
 A.DueDateOffset AS DueDateOffset, 
 A.LimitedRouting AS LimitedRouting, 
 A.insertedby AS insertedby, 
 A.insertedon AS insertedon, 
 A.updatedby AS updatedby, 
 A.updatedon AS updatedon, 
 A.EffectiveDate AS EffectiveDate, 
 A.ExpirationDate AS ExpirationDate, 
 A.FocusRoletype AS FocusRoletype, 
 A.Category AS Category, 
 B.IntakeServReqTypeId AS IntakeServReqTypeId, 
 B.IntakeServReqTypeKey AS IntakeServReqTypeKey, 
 B.Description AS Description, 
 B.insertedby AS insertedby1, 
 B.insertedon AS insertedon1, 
 B.updatedby AS updatedby1, 
 B.updatedon AS updatedon1, 
 B.ArchiveOn AS ArchiveOn, 
 B.ArchiveBy AS ArchiveBy, 
 B.timestamp AS timestamp, 
 B.WorkLoadWeight AS WorkLoadWeight, 
 B.Investigatable AS Investigatable, 
 C.ServiceRequestSubTypeId AS ServiceRequestSubTypeId, 
 C.IntakeServReqTypeId AS IntakeServReqTypeId1, 
 C.ClassKey AS ClassKey, 
 C.Description AS Description1, 
 C.insertedby AS insertedby2, 
 C.insertedon AS insertedon2, 
 C.updatedby AS updatedby2, 
 C.updatedon AS updatedon2, 
 C.timestamp AS timestamp1, 
 C.WorkLoadWeight AS WorkLoadWeight1, 
 C.Investigatable AS Investigatable1, 
 D.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId AS IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId, 
 D.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeKey AS IntakeSerReqStatusTypeKey, 
 D.Description AS Description2, 
 D.insertedby AS insertedby3, 
 D.insertedon AS insertedon3, 
 D.updatedby AS updatedby3, 
 D.updatedon AS updatedon3, 
 D.ActiveFlag AS ActiveFlag1, 
 D.EffectiveDate AS EffectiveDate1, 
 D.ExpirationDate AS ExpirationDate1, 
 D.timestamp AS Timestamp2, 
 E.SequenceNumber AS SequenceNumber, 
 E.IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey AS IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey, 
 E.ActiveFlag AS ActiveFlag2, 
 E.TypeDescription AS TypeDescription, 
 E.DataValue AS DataValue, 
 E.editable AS editable, 
 E.EffectiveDate AS EffectiveDate2, 
 E.ExpirationDate AS ExpirationDate2, 
 E.old_id AS old_id, 
 E.timestamp AS Timestamp3, 
 1 AS C1, 
 1 AS C2, 
 F.ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId, 
 F.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId AS ServiceRequestTypeConfigId1, 
 F.EntityRoleType AS EntityRoleType, 
 F.EntityRoleTypeKey AS EntityRoleTypeKey, 
 F.ActiveFlag AS ActiveFlag3, 
 F.EffectiveDate AS EffectiveDate3, 
 F.ExpirationDate AS ExpirationDate3, 
 F.insertedby AS insertedby4, 
 F.insertedon AS insertedon4, 
 F.updatedby AS updatedby4, 
 F.updatedon AS updatedon4, 
 F.timestamp AS timestamp4, 
 CASE WHEN (F.ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId IS NULL) THEN CAST(NULL AS int) ELSE 1 END AS C3, 
 CASE WHEN (F.ServiceRequestTypeConfigRoleId IS NULL) THEN CAST(NULL AS int) ELSE 1 END AS C4
 FROM      ServiceRequestTypeConfig AS A
 LEFT OUTER JOIN IntakeServiceRequestType AS B ON A.IntakeServReqTypeId = B.IntakeServReqTypeId
 LEFT OUTER JOIN ServiceRequestSubType AS C ON A.ServiceRequestSubTypeId = C.ServiceRequestSubTypeId
 LEFT OUTER JOIN IntakeSerReqStatusType AS D ON A.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId = D.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId
 LEFT OUTER JOIN IntakeServiceRequestPlanType AS E ON A.IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey = E.IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey
 LEFT OUTER JOIN ServiceRequestTypeConfigRole AS F ON A.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId = F.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId
 WHERE  EXISTS (SELECT 
  cast(1 as bit) AS C1
  FROM ServiceRequestTypeConfigRole AS Extent7
  WHERE (A.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId = Extent7.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId) and Extent7.activeflag=1 and Extent7.EntityRoleType= 'DocumentType'
 )
)  AS G
ORDER BY G.ServiceRequestTypeConfigId ASC, G.IntakeServReqTypeId ASC, G.ServiceRequestSubTypeId ASC, G.IntakeSerReqStatusTypeId ASC, G.IntakeServiceRequestPlanTypeKey ASC, G.C4 ASC LIMIT v_liPageSize OFFSET v_pageoffset;
  END;
$function$

